  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "**切片**（`[]T`）是对数组（或一块内存）的长度可变的视图。如果函数参数是 `[]i32`，它就接受任意大小的数组。想取子范围，写 `array[a..b]`（不含 `b`）。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn sum(items: []i32) -> i32:",
    "    total = 0",
    "    for x in items:",
    "        total += x",
    "    return total",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    data: [5]i32 = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]",
    "    print(\"total:\", sum(data))",
    "    print(\"part:\", sum(data[1..4]))"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "total: 15",
    "part: 9"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "切片是一个视图，所以在切片被使用期间，它所基于的数组不能被修改、移动或消失。编译器会检查这一点，因此切片永远不会“悬空”。"
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c04-l05-x1",
   "prompt": "编写 `average(items: []i32) -> i32`：元素之和除以元素个数（`items.len` 是 `usize`，用 `i32(items.len)` 转换）。对 `[2, 4, 6, 8]` 输出结果。",
   "starter": [
    "fn average(items: []i32) -> i32:",
    "    return 0",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    data: [4]i32 = [2, 4, 6, 8]",
    "    print(average(data))"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn average(items: []i32) -> i32:",
    "    total = 0",
    "    for x in items:",
    "        total += x",
    "    return total / i32(items.len)",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    data: [4]i32 = [2, 4, 6, 8]",
    "    print(average(data))"
   ],
   "hint": "先求总和，再除以 `i32(items.len)`。",
   "expected": [
    "5"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
